 #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 23.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 28.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 20\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Half Marathon 21 KM<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 29 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2025)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 30.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 20\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as datas e hor\u00e1rios de partida da Ger\u00eas Extreme Marathon 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre de 27 a 29 de novembro de 2026: na sexta-feira (27\/11) parte a Extreme Mile \u00e0s 15:30; no s\u00e1bado (28\/11) partem o Extreme 90K (06:00, 07:00 e 08:00) e a Race 12 km (11:30); no domingo (29\/11) partem os 42 km e 14 km \u00e0s 09:00 e os 21 km \u00e0s 09:15.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam o secretariado e os locais de partida das provas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Expo Running, o secretariado e a meta principal situam-se na Praceta Hon\u00f3rio de Lima, na Vila do Ger\u00eas (Terras de Bouro, Braga). A Extreme Mile parte de Vilarinho das Furnas e a Race 12 km parte do Museu da Geira, ambas com transfer assegurado.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A Ger\u00eas Extreme Marathon \u00e9 uma prova de estrada ou de trail running?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Trata-se de uma prova de corrida de estrada em montanha, disputada em percurso asfaltado, pavimentado e estrad\u00f5es dentro do Parque Nacional da Peneda-Ger\u00eas, caracterizando-se pelos seus acentuados desn\u00edveis positivos e negativos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 3 fases (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2025, at\u00e9 30\/09\/2026 e at\u00e9 20\/11\/2026): 42 km (35 \u20ac \/ 40 \u20ac \/ 45 \u20ac), 21 km (20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac \/ 30 \u20ac), 14 km e 12 km (18 \u20ac \/ 23 \u20ac \/ 28 \u20ac) e Extreme Mile (pre\u00e7o \u00fanico de 15 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a prova e quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite dos 42 km e 90 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o pertence \u00e0 Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Terras de Bouro. O tempo limite na Maratona 42 km \u00e9 de 7 horas (com barreira hor\u00e1ria aos 29 km no Museu da Geira \u00e0s 5h15 de prova) e entre 14h e 16h no Extreme 90K.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ger\u00eas Extreme Marathon 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-27\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Terras de Bouro, Braga\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Terras de Bouro\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Ger\u00eas Extreme Marathon 2026 realiza-se de 27 a 29 de novembro em Terras de Bouro. Provas de 90 km, 42 km, 21 km, 14 km, 12 km e Milha. Garante a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-geres-extreme-marathon.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Extreme Mile\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/carlossanatureevents.com\/gema\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Race 12 KM\", \"price\": \"28.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/carlossanatureevents.com\/gema\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Marathon 42 KM\", \"price\": \"45.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/carlossanatureevents.com\/gema\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Race 14 KM\", \"price\": \"28.00\", \"priceCurrency\"